# Private source media: the supplied photographs and design references are not an archive for this public repository.
# Only the sanitized WebP derivatives (scripts/passion-fruit-images.mjs) and the Playwright baselines are committed.
# See "Supplier confidentiality" in AGENTS.md.
/src/assets/passion-fruit/*.jpg
/src/assets/passion-fruit/*.jpeg
/src/assets/passion-fruit/*.png
/specs/references/*.png

# HMV original photographs of the products (location stamps, plates, people): never committed; the site imports the WebP
# exports. This was a per-machine rule in .git/info/exclude; it belongs here so every clone and every agent has it.
/src/assets/products/*.jpg
/src/assets/products/*.jpeg
/src/assets/products/*.png
